{"id":"gradable-adjectives","lv":"b2","n":31,"cat":"adjectives","t":"Very tired hay absolutely exhausted?","en":"very good · absolutely amazing","sum":"Tính từ thường (có mức độ): tired, good, cold, big, angry — đi với very, extremely, a bit, fairly: very tired, a bit cold. Tính từ cực độ: exhausted, amazing, excellent, terrible, freezing, huge, tiny, furious, delicious, starving — tự mang nghĩa “rất”, đi với absolutely, completely, totally: absolutely exhausted. Không nói very exhausted, cũng không nói absolutely tired. Really dùng được cho cả hai.","forms":[{"f":"very / extremely / a bit + tính từ thường","vi":"very tired · a bit cold"},{"f":"absolutely / completely + tính từ cực độ","vi":"absolutely exhausted"},{"f":"really: dùng được cho cả hai","vi":"really tired · really amazing"},{"f":"không nói very exhausted · absolutely tired","vi":"chọn từ nhấn đúng loại"}],"pts":[{"id":"gradable-adjectives","name":"Gradable & extreme adjectives","vi":"Very tired khác absolutely exhausted"}],"cast":{"zoe":{"name":{"en":"Zoe","vi":"Zoe"},"look":"teengirl","style":{"top":"#E0607E","topShade":"#C44B68","accent":"#C44B68","hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#8B5A2B"},"x":560},"mom":{"name":{"en":"Mom","vi":"Mẹ"},"look":"mom","x":1040}},"bg":"home-evening","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Mom, I'm absolutely exhausted! We walked twenty kilometers today.","vi":"Mẹ ơi, con mệt rã rời! Hôm nay bọn con đi bộ hai mươi cây số.","ipa":["mɑm","aɪm","ˌæbsəˈlutli","ɪɡˈzɔstɪd","wi","wɔkt","ˈtwɛnti","kəˈlɑˌmʌtɚz","təˈdeɪ"],"who":"zoe","ann":{"expression":"tired"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":4.936,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,1.101],[2,1.301],[3,1.913],[4,3.026],[5,3.163],[6,3.464],[7,3.788],[8,4.426]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Wow! Was it very hard?","vi":"Chà! Có vất vả lắm không con?","ipa":["waʊ","wɑz","ɪt","ˈvɛɹi","hɑɹd"],"who":"mom","ann":{"expression":"surprised"},"b":1,"start":5.726,"end":8.056,"timing":[[0,5.726],[1,7.029],[2,7.229],[3,7.329],[4,7.629]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Yes,